    </p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-[10px] text-slate-600">
      {isFr
        ? 'Monument Assurance est fermé aux nouvelles souscriptions (run-off).'
        : "Monument Assurance is closed to new business (run-off)."}
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── Benefits / Disadvantages ─── -->
  <section class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-emerald-800/40 bg-emerald-950/20 p-6">
      <h3 class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-300">
        <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-emerald-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
        </svg>
        {isFr ? 'Avantages' : 'Benefits'}
      </h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-400">•</span>
          <span>{isFr ? 'Séparation des biens (compartiment dédié) : protection en cas de faillite de l\'assureur' : 'Asset segregation (dedicated compartment): protection in case of insurer bankruptcy'}</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-400">•</span>
          <span>{isFr ? 'Surveillance par le Commissariat aux Assurances (CAA) sous Solvabilité II' : 'Supervised by the CAA under Solvability II'}</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-400">•</span>
          <span>{isFr ? 'Accès à des supports indisponibles en France (ETF US, OPCVM étrangers, PE, fonds institutionnels)' : 'Access to supports unavailable in France (US ETFs, foreign UCITS, PE, institutional funds)'}</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-400">•</span>
          <span>{isFr ? 'Option pour la capitalisation : pas d\'impôt annuel sur les plus-values' : 'Capitalisation option: no annual tax on capital gains'}</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-400">•</span>
          <span>{isFr ? 'Mêmes avantages successoraux qu\'une AV française (art. 990 I du CGI)' : 'Same inheritance benefits as a French AV (art. 990 I CGI)'}</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-400">•</span>
          <span>{isFr ? 'Devises multiples (EUR, USD, CHF, GBP) et diversification géographique renforcée' : 'Multi-currency (EUR, USD, CHF, GBP) and enhanced geographic diversification'}</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-400">•</span>
          <span>{isFr ? 'Transparence accrue sur les frais et la composition des actifs' : 'Greater transparency on fees and asset composition'}</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-red-900/40 bg-red-950/20 p-6">
      <h3 class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-red-300">
        <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-red-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 14l2-2m0 0l2-2m-2 2l-2-2m2 2l2 2m7-2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
        </svg>
        {isFr ? 'Inconvénients' : 'Disadvantages'}
      </h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-red-400">•</span>
          <span>{isFr ? 'Frais de structure annuels (0,10 % à 0,25 %) que n\'ont pas les contrats français' : 'Annual structure fees (0.10% to 0.25%) that French contracts do not have'}</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-red-400">•</span>
          <span>{isFr ? 'Frais de gestion globaux plus élevés (0,50 % à 1,50 %) que les meilleurs contrats français' : 'Higher overall management fees (0.50% to 1.50%) than the best French contracts'}</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-red-400">•</span>
          <span>{isFr ? 'Seuil d\'entrée minimum élevé (souvent 50 000 € à 100 000 €, voire 500 000 €)' : 'High minimum investment (often €50,000 to €100,000, up to €500,000)'}</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-red-400">•</span>
          <span>{isFr ? 'Complexité et nécessité de passer par un intermédiaire (CGPI, courtier) pour la plupart des contrats' : 'Complexity and need for an intermediary (wealth advisor, broker) for most contracts'}</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-red-400">•</span>
          <span>{isFr ? 'Frais d\'entrée potentiels (0 % à 5 %, parfois négociables) si passage par un intermédiaire' : 'Potential entry fees (0% to 5%, sometimes negotiable) when using an intermediary'}</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-red-400">•</span>
          <span>{isFr ? 'Pas de fonds en euros aussi performant qu\'en France (le fonds euro luxembourgeois est souvent moins rémunérateur)' : 'Euro fund performance lower than in France (Luxembourg euro fund is often less rewarding)'}</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-red-400">•</span>
          <span>{isFr ? 'Fiscalité franco-luxembourgeoise complexe : nécessité de déclarer le contrat au titre du DAC6 / CbC' : 'Complex Franco-Luxembourg taxation: DAC6 / CbC reporting requirements'}</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── Final verdict ─── -->
  <section class="rounded-xl border border-purple-800/40 bg-purple-950/20 p-6">
    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-purple-300">
      {isFr ? 'Verdict' : 'Verdict'}
    </h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
      {isFr
        ? 'L\'assurance vie luxembourgeoise est un outil patrimonial puissant — mais pas pour tout le monde. Elle est pertinente pour les patrimoines supérieurs à 200 000 €, les investisseurs cherchant une diversification avancée (US ETF, private equity, multi-devises) et ceux qui veulent une protection renforcée via la séparation des biens. Pour une épargne inférieure à 100 000 €, un contrat français sans frais d\'entrée (Linxea, BoursoBank, Fortuneo) sera plus efficient.'
        : 'Luxembourg life insurance is a powerful wealth tool — but not for everyone. It is relevant for portfolios above €200,000, investors seeking advanced diversification (US ETFs, private equity, multi-currency), and those wanting enhanced protection through asset segregation. For savings under €100,000, a no-entry-fee French contract (Linxea, BoursoBank, Fortuneo) will be more efficient.'}
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── Provider List ─── -->
  <section>
    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-100" data-i18n="lux.list.title">{T["lux.list.title"]}</h2>
    <p class="mb-5 text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="lux.list.note">{T["lux.list.note"]}</p>

    <!-- Legend -->
    <div class="mb-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[11px]">
      <span class="rounded border border-emerald-700/30 bg-emerald-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-emerald-400">{isFr ? 'Assureur lux. (CAA)' : 'LU insurer (CAA)'}</span>
      <span class="rounded border border-blue-700/30 bg-blue-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-blue-400">{isFr ? 'Marque blanche' : 'White-label'}</span>
      <span class="rounded border border-amber-700/30 bg-amber-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-amber-400">{isFr ? 'Distributeur CGPI' : 'Distributor/advisor'}</span>
      <span class="rounded border border-purple-700/30 bg-purple-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-purple-400">{isFr ? 'LPS (assureur étranger)' : 'LPS (foreign insurer)'}</span>
      <span class="rounded border border-red-700/30 bg-red-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-red-400">{isFr ? 'Non trouvé registre CAA' : 'Not in CAA registry'}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      {providers.map((p) => (
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-purple-500/20 hover:bg-slate-900/60">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between gap-3">
            <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5">
                <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100" data-i18n={p.nameKey}>{T[p.nameKey]}</h3>
                <span class={`inline-flex items-center rounded border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium leading-tight ${typeBadgeColor(p.type)}`}>
